[{"page": 1, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-1", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "T2. Kinetics of the Belousov-Zhabotinsky reaction", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 151.06434631347656, 449.7819519042969, 172.77197265625]}, {"text": "6%", "bbox": [290.6499938964844, 193.70750427246094, 304.6280822753906, 207.2747344970703]}, {"text": "2.1", "bbox": [172.68299865722656, 209.6475067138672, 186.7479705810547, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.2", "bbox": [204.3090057373047, 209.6475067138672, 218.37399291992188, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.3", "bbox": [235.93499755859375, 209.6475067138672, 249.99998474121094, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.4", "bbox": [267.5610046386719, 209.6475067138672, 281.6259765625, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.5", "bbox": [299.18701171875, 209.6475067138672, 313.2519836425781, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.6", "bbox": [330.81298828125, 209.6475067138672, 344.8779602050781, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "2.7", "bbox": [362.4389953613281, 209.6475067138672, 376.50396728515625, 223.21473693847656]}, {"text": "∑", "bbox": [403.7760009765625, 194.75196838378906, 412.8818054199219, 229.34210205078125]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [176.86700439453125, 225.5885009765625, 182.5634002685547, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "11", "bbox": [205.64500427246094, 225.5885009765625, 217.04000854492188, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "4", "bbox": [240.11900329589844, 225.5885009765625, 245.81539916992188, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [271.7449951171875, 225.5885009765625, 277.4413757324219, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "9", "bbox": [303.3710021972656, 225.5885009765625, 309.0673828125, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "4", "bbox": [334.99700927734375, 225.5885009765625, 340.6933898925781, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [366.62298583984375, 225.5885009765625, 372.3193664550781, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "35", "bbox": [402.6319885253906, 225.5885009765625, 414.0269775390625, 239.15573120117188]}, {"text": "When the chemicals KBrO3, CH2(COOH)2 (malonic acid, – MA), Ce(SO4)2, and H2SO4 are mixed, the", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 234.54714965820312, 538.5816650390625, 300.49957275390625]}, {"text": "concentration, 𝐶, of Ce species and the colour of the solution oscillates between yellow (due to Ce4+)", "bbox": [56.69293212890625, 248.5091552734375, 538.582763671875, 314.4615783691406]}, {"text": "and colourless (due to Ce3+). A schematic picture is given below:", "bbox": [56.692901611328125, 261.9451599121094, 357.6814880371094, 327.8975830078125]}, {"text": "2.1", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 548.0745239257812, 92.84233856201172, 561.6417236328125]}, {"text": "Write the overall balanced reaction equation of the Belousov-Zhabotinsky reac-", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 548.0745239257812, 480.5935974121094, 561.6417236328125]}, {"text": "tion (BZ reaction). Note: in this reaction, MA is oxidised to CO2, BrO−", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 535.2111206054688, 430.1299743652344, 601.1635131835938]}, {"text": "3 is reduced", "bbox": [423.98797607421875, 552.376220703125, 480.5915832519531, 583.507568359375]}, {"text": "to Br−, and Ce(IV) is a catalyst.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 548.608154296875, 257.0640869140625, 614.560546875]}, {"text": "2.0 pt", "bbox": [495.449951171875, 547.99951171875, 521.8193969726562, 561.5667114257812]}]}, {"page": 2, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-2", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "The mechanism of the BZ reaction is shown below (BMA −CHBr(COOH)2):", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 130.40113830566406, 407.3403625488281, 196.35354614257812]}, {"text": "Process A", "bbox": [63.069000244140625, 226.5465087890625, 108.03180694580078, 240.11373901367188]}, {"text": "⎧", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 186.3079833984375, 117.00606536865234, 220.89813232421875]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 195.3359832763672, 117.00606536865234, 229.92611694335938]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 204.7539825439453, 117.00606536865234, 239.3441162109375]}, {"text": "⎨", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 214.17198181152344, 117.00606536865234, 248.76211547851562]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 223.58998107910156, 117.00606536865234, 258.18011474609375]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 233.00698852539062, 117.00606536865234, 267.5971374511719]}, {"text": "⎩", "bbox": [110.6300048828125, 241.98599243164062, 117.00606536865234, 276.5761413574219]}, {"text": "(1) HBrO2 + BrO−", "bbox": [117.00599670410156, 180.0631561279297, 198.4779815673828, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "3 + H+ 𝑘1", "bbox": [192.33599853515625, 180.0631561279297, 238.69305419921875, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [227.10800170898438, 189.9659881591797, 233.93238830566406, 224.55612182617188]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [230.65469360351562, 189.9659881591797, 237.4790802001953, 224.55612182617188]}, {"text": "→2BrO⋅", "bbox": [234.20138549804688, 180.0631561279297, 272.44940185546875, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "2 + H2O", "bbox": [269.885009765625, 180.0631561279297, 306.32293701171875, 246.01556396484375]}, {"text": "(2) BrO⋅", "bbox": [117.00602722167969, 205.04115295410156, 152.4844207763672, 270.9935607910156]}, {"text": "2 + Ce3+ + H+ 𝑘2", "bbox": [149.92002868652344, 205.0411376953125, 228.61106872558594, 270.9935607910156]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [217.02601623535156, 214.9439697265625, 223.85040283203125, 249.53411865234375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [220.5727081298828, 214.9439697265625, 227.3970947265625, 249.53411865234375]}, {"text": "→HBrO2 + Ce4+", "bbox": [224.11940002441406, 205.0411376953125, 300.7682189941406, 270.9935607910156]}, {"text": "(3) 2HBrO2", "bbox": [117.00602722167969, 229.74212646484375, 166.85623168945312, 295.6945495605469]}, {"text": "𝑘3", "bbox": [172.86203002929688, 233.89022827148438, 181.7070770263672, 266.3609313964844]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [170.12203979492188, 239.64495849609375, 176.94642639160156, 274.235107421875]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [173.66871643066406, 239.64495849609375, 180.49310302734375, 274.235107421875]}, {"text": "→BrO−", "bbox": [177.21539306640625, 229.74212646484375, 214.0590057373047, 295.6945495605469]}, {"text": "3 + HBrO + H+", "bbox": [207.91702270507812, 229.74212646484375, 276.8590087890625, 295.6945495605469]}, {"text": "𝑘1 = 1.0 × 104 M−2 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439880371094, 175.41314697265625, 514.3911743164062, 245.35154724121094]}, {"text": "𝑘2 = 6.2 × 104 M−2 s−1", "bbox": [412.74395751953125, 193.0321502685547, 514.39111328125, 262.9695739746094]}, {"text": "𝑘3 = 4.0 × 107 M−1 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439270019531, 210.650146484375, 514.39111328125, 280.58856201171875]}, {"text": "Process B", "bbox": [63.069000244140625, 296.4905090332031, 108.13882446289062, 310.0577392578125]}, {"text": "⎧", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 257.37799072265625, 117.1130599975586, 291.9681396484375]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 265.6769714355469, 117.1130599975586, 300.2671203613281]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 274.8959655761719, 117.1130599975586, 309.4861145019531]}, {"text": "⎨", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 284.1149597167969, 117.1130599975586, 318.7051086425781]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 293.3339538574219, 117.1130599975586, 327.9241027832031]}, {"text": "⎪", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 302.5529479980469, 117.1130599975586, 337.1430969238281]}, {"text": "⎩", "bbox": [110.73699951171875, 310.8029479980469, 117.1130599975586, 345.3930969238281]}, {"text": "(4) HBrO2 + Br−+ H+ 𝑘4", "bbox": [117.11299896240234, 251.13311767578125, 231.04905700683594, 317.0855407714844]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [219.4650115966797, 261.03594970703125, 226.28939819335938, 295.6260986328125]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [223.01170349121094, 261.03594970703125, 229.83609008789062, 295.6260986328125]}, {"text": "→2HBrO", "bbox": [226.5583953857422, 251.13311767578125, 269.7127380371094, 317.0855407714844]}, {"text": "(5) BrO−", "bbox": [117.11300659179688, 274.97711181640625, 156.1689910888672, 340.9295349121094]}, {"text": "3 + Br−+ 2H+ 𝑘5", "bbox": [150.02700805664062, 274.97711181640625, 230.21705627441406, 340.9295349121094]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [218.6330108642578, 284.87994384765625, 225.4573974609375, 319.4700927734375]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [222.17970275878906, 284.87994384765625, 229.00408935546875, 319.4700927734375]}, {"text": "→HBrO + HBrO2", "bbox": [225.7263946533203, 274.97711181640625, 305.81719970703125, 340.9295349121094]}, {"text": "(6) HBrO + MA", "bbox": [117.11302185058594, 299.8041076660156, 185.35968017578125, 365.75653076171875]}, {"text": "𝑘6", "bbox": [190.86703491210938, 303.9521789550781, 199.71206665039062, 336.4228820800781]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [188.1270294189453, 309.7069396972656, 194.951416015625, 344.2970886230469]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [191.6737060546875, 309.7069396972656, 198.4980926513672, 344.2970886230469]}, {"text": "→BMA + H2O", "bbox": [195.22039794921875, 299.8041076660156, 262.3309326171875, 365.75653076171875]}, {"text": "𝑘4 = 2.0 × 109 M−2 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439880371094, 250.80712890625, 514.3911743164062, 320.74554443359375]}, {"text": "𝑘5 = 2.1 M−3 s−1", "bbox": [412.74395751953125, 268.4261474609375, 488.64312744140625, 338.3635559082031]}, {"text": "𝑘6 = 8.2 M−1 s−1", "bbox": [412.74395751953125, 286.04412841796875, 488.64312744140625, 355.9825439453125]}, {"text": "Process C {(7) Ce4+ + BMA", "bbox": [63.069000244140625, 338.1351318359375, 193.13418579101562, 404.0875549316406]}, {"text": "𝑘7", "bbox": [198.64199829101562, 342.3312072753906, 207.48704528808594, 374.8019104003906]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [195.90200805664062, 348.0379638671875, 202.7263946533203, 382.62811279296875]}, {"text": "−", "bbox": [199.4486846923828, 348.0379638671875, 206.2730712890625, 382.62811279296875]}, {"text": "→Ce3+ + Br−+ other products", "bbox": [202.99537658691406, 338.1351318359375, 348.3592529296875, 404.0875549316406]}, {"text": "𝑘7 = 1.0 × 102 M−1 s−1", "bbox": [412.7439880371094, 330.6851501464844, 514.3911743164062, 400.6235656738281]}, {"text": "In the BZ reaction, Process C occurs continuously, while Processes A and B alternate with each other.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 404.8955078125, 538.5765380859375, 418.4627380371094]}, {"text": "Assume that:", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 416.8504943847656, 117.88394165039062, 430.417724609375]}, {"text": "- when Process A occurs the solution is yellow and Process B practically does not occur;", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 434.78350830078125, 466.40802001953125, 448.3507385253906]}, {"text": "- when Process B occurs the solution is colourless and Process A practically does not occur;", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 452.71551513671875, 484.2220458984375, 466.2827453613281]}, {"text": "- [BrO3−]0 = 0.06 M, [MA]0 = 0.1 M, [H+]0 = 0.8 M, [Ce4+]0 = 0.001 M;", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 456.16021728515625, 374.41668701171875, 494.67010498046875]}, {"text": "- the concentrations of the reactants (except Ce4+) and pH are maintained constant throughout the BZ", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 467.2851257324219, 538.5810546875, 533.237548828125]}, {"text": "reaction.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 504.0584716796875, 97.72960662841797, 517.6256713867188]}, {"text": "2.2", "bbox": [78.60799407958984, 526.970458984375, 92.84233093261719, 540.5376586914062]}, {"text": "Using the steady-state approximation, calculate the stationary molar concen-", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 526.970458984375, 480.5784912109375, 540.5377197265625]}, {"text": "trations of HBrO2 in Processes A and B, [HBrO2]A and [HBrO2]B.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 514.1071166992188, 418.2455749511719, 582.5504760742188]}, {"text": "11.0 pt", "bbox": [495.1519470214844, 526.8944702148438, 526.9210815429688, 540.461669921875]}, {"text": "If you could not calculate [HBrO2]A and [HBrO2]B, you can use the values [HBrO2]A = 1 × 10−5 M and", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 544.3441772460938, 538.5824584960938, 610.2965698242188]}, {"text": "[HBrO2]B = 1 × 10−10 M for the following calculations.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 557.878173828125, 300.0137939453125, 623.83056640625]}]}, {"page": 3, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-3", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "During the BZ reaction, the concentrations of HBrO2 and Br−oscillate strictly in relation to each other,", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 130.40113830566406, 538.5963134765625, 196.35354614257812]}, {"text": "and this is sketched in the phase portrait of [HBrO2] vs [Br−]:", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 142.35614013671875, 341.3666076660156, 208.3085479736328]}, {"text": "Here [Br−]max is the maximum concentration and [Br−]critical is the critical concentration of Br−at which", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 415.3631286621094, 538.5804443359375, 481.3155517578125]}, {"text": "there is a switch over in processes from A to B or from B to A. To switch Process A to Process B, the", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 452.136474609375, 538.5736083984375, 465.7037048339844]}, {"text": "reaction rate of the elementary step (4) must exceed that of the elementary step (1) and vice versa.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 464.09246826171875, 517.005615234375, 477.6596984863281]}, {"text": "2.3", "bbox": [78.60802459716797, 487.00347900390625, 92.84236145019531, 500.5707092285156]}, {"text": "Calculate [Br−]critical.", "bbox": [114.69256591796875, 462.1851501464844, 217.95263671875, 528.1375732421875]}, {"text": "4.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 486.9284973144531, 521.8194580078125, 500.4957275390625]}, {"text": "If you could not calculate [Br−]critical, use [Br−]critical = 1 × 10−7 M for the following calculations.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 492.86810302734375, 490.7857360839844, 558.8204956054688]}, {"text": "2.4", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 540.6514892578125, 92.84233856201172, 554.2186889648438]}, {"text": "In which direction in the phase portrait of [HBrO2] vs [Br−] will the concentra-", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 515.8331298828125, 480.5902404785156, 581.7855224609375]}, {"text": "tions of [HBrO2] and [Br−] change over time? Tick the correct box.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 527.7881469726562, 425.509765625, 593.7405395507812]}, {"text": "2.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 540.5755004882812, 521.8194580078125, 554.1427001953125]}, {"text": "The system does not traverse the phase portrait of [HBrO2] vs [Br−] at a constant velocity, that is the", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 558.4701538085938, 538.5867309570312, 624.4225463867188]}, {"text": "concentration of [Br−] slowly decreases from [Br−]max = 7.0 × 10−4 M to [Br−]critical, and then almost", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 572.004150390625, 538.5718994140625, 637.95654296875]}, {"text": "immediately reaches [Br−]max again.", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 583.9591674804688, 229.1018829345703, 649.9115600585938]}, {"text": "2.5", "bbox": [78.60795593261719, 631.7435302734375, 92.84229278564453, 645.3107299804688]}, {"text": "Calculate based on the data the period of oscillations, 𝜏, of the BZ reaction, in", "bbox": [114.69249725341797, 616.8280029296875, 480.58551025390625, 651.4181518554688]}, {"text": "seconds.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 643.6985473632812, 155.61802673339844, 657.2657470703125]}, {"text": "9.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 631.6675415039062, 521.8194580078125, 645.2347412109375]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-4", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "2.6", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "What will be the effect if the following actions (1-4) are performed on an open", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 166.2294921875, 480.5633544921875, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "system where a BZ reaction is taking place? Tick only one box (a-e) for each", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 178.18450927734375, 480.5770568847656, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "case.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 190.1405029296875, 138.1237030029297, 203.70773315429688]}, {"text": "1. Adding of small amount of Ce4+", "bbox": [121.06700134277344, 203.72413635253906, 282.1211853027344, 269.6765441894531]}, {"text": "during Process A.", "bbox": [121.06700134277344, 240.4974822998047, 204.81063842773438, 254.06471252441406]}, {"text": "2. Adding of a small amount of Ag+", "bbox": [121.06700134277344, 229.9481201171875, 286.6520080566406, 295.9005432128906]}, {"text": "during Process B.", "bbox": [121.0670166015625, 266.72149658203125, 204.6306610107422, 280.2887268066406]}, {"text": "3. Adding of a small amount of Br−", "bbox": [121.06702423095703, 253.85812377929688, 285.1580505371094, 319.810546875]}, {"text": "during Process B.", "bbox": [121.06703186035156, 